# Acceptance criteria
- `/api/goals/today` after 3 missed daily periods deducts
  `3 * penaltyPoints` exactly once; an immediate second call deducts nothing.
- A goal created today produces zero penalty on first load.
- Check-in, then an immediate second check-in the same day -> 409, no double
  points, no second `CheckIn` row.
- First check-in of the day increments `user.streak` by exactly 1 and awards
  the flat `+5`; a second check-in that day on a *different* goal awards
  points but does not increment streak again.
- `answers` with a whitespace-only entry, or an invalid `mood`, returns 400
  with no verifier call.
- `GET /api/goals` never writes to the ledger, under any goal state.
- A goal whose `endDate` has passed appears under `ended`, not `active`.
- A check-in with Band env unset (or Band erroring) returns an unchanged
  200 `CheckInResponse`; with Band configured, the goal gains a persisted
  `bandRoomId` on its first check-in and a JSON mention lands in the room.
